{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1537700583,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMzgwODMzNg==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2867#issuecomment-423808336"},"message":"After a few more stops on the thought train I realized that there might be no need for a `sync` command, because it will be overlapping very much with the functionality already exposed via `update`. What sync would need to do is an `update` that is not forcefully limited to stuff coming down from a remote. Which it would be already, if we would not disable it.\n\nSo a bi/multi-directional `update` would be all we need. The distinction from `publish` would then be:\n\n- update: an existing, fixed set of local repositories and their remotes are sync'ed, either uni-directionally  (down: present `update`, up present `publish`, or both ways: present `annex sync`)\n- publish: all magic components on top of `update` (some aspects still have to remain bidirectional and code will get leaner thanks to bidirectional `update`. Magic aspects would include:\n  - creation of remote siblings on servers\n  - anticipation of update necessity by taking the locally reflected state of a remote as ground truth\n\nThis would imply that `publish` could not use the `--recursive` mode of `update`.\n\nAmazingly this will fix all publish-related v6 issues that I can think of, as `update` already relies on `sync` for any annex repo (and by definition does the correct thing), and only special-cases plain Git repos, which cannot be v5, v6 or direct mode.\n\nMuch happier now.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1561524228,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUwNTcxNTg4OA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2867#issuecomment-505715888"},"message":"I will close this (for now). Had a surprisingly good experience with publishing from an adjusted branch. No need for gloomy predictions.","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1561524228,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MjQzOTYwMzA0Nw=="},"status":2}]}